    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Clean Minesweeper</strong> is a modern take on the classic logic game \u2014 no guessing, no distractions, just pure reasoning.</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>100% logic solvable</strong> \u2013 Every tile can be cleared with deduction. No guessing required.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Minimalist, elegant visuals</strong> \u2013 Soft colors and clean layout that reduce visual noise.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple difficulty modes</strong> \u2013 From quick casual rounds to expert-level challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Smooth &amp; responsive controls</strong> \u2013 Click with confidence and speed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relaxing atmosphere</strong> \u2013 A calm game for focused minds or peaceful breaks.</p></li></ul>",
